    given-names: Juan Sebastian
repository-code: https://github.com/molanocortes/OpenPhysicsAI
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - additive manufacturing simulation
  - laser powder bed fusion distortion
  - inherent strain calibration
  - residual stress
  - finite element analysis
  - open source Simufact alternative
  - engineering benchmark
  - AI agents
abstract: Open-source, AI-native engineering simulation with public challenges against measured reality. Additive-manufacturing process simulation (LPBF, FFF), structures, heat and fluids, driven by people through a native app and by AI agents through typed operations, with pre-registered validation and replayable leaderboards.
